      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a report for a client. we're trying to map out current social media trends and how \"high-end\" or \"refined\" they feel for brand placement. i have a few different styles and types of slang popping up in my data and i need help categorizing them. can you help me rank them based on how sophisticated they seem to a general audience vs how \"street\" or niche they feel?",
